WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:01.800
You finish the stream…

00:02.030 --> 00:03.970
and you're left with three hours of editing.

00:04.300 --> 00:05.520
Five programs:

00:05.680 --> 00:07.570
chat, bot, alerts,

00:07.680 --> 00:09.040
clips and uploading.

00:09.300 --> 00:11.940
What if one did it all?

00:12.900 --> 00:14.380
This is Vodwise.

00:14.680 --> 00:16.150
Your copilot during the stream

00:16.350 --> 00:17.530
and your editor afterwards.

00:17.780 --> 00:18.890
On your own PC.

00:19.400 --> 00:21.970
Before you start, it prepares the title,

00:21.950 --> 00:24.030
the thumbnail and the social posts.

00:24.360 --> 00:25.510
You just say yes.

00:26.000 --> 00:27.170
During the stream,

00:27.430 --> 00:28.950
all the chat in one window,

00:29.130 --> 00:30.790
the bot on all three platforms

00:30.920 --> 00:32.320
and scenes that change with your voice.

00:32.600 --> 00:33.790
And it moderates with you:

00:34.060 --> 00:35.020
it filters spam

00:35.220 --> 00:37.390
and never bans anyone without asking you.

00:37.900 --> 00:40.450
And when you're done, it reviews your stream,

00:40.820 --> 00:42.340
picks the best moments

00:42.590 --> 00:43.990
and puts together the full video,

00:44.360 --> 00:45.510
the stream highlights

00:45.610 --> 00:47.110
and the Shorts with subtitles.

00:52.600 --> 00:54.800
Your recordings never leave your computer.

00:55.070 --> 00:57.350
And nothing is published without your approval.

00:57.700 --> 00:59.070
You do the stream.

00:59.290 --> 01:00.710
Vodwise does the rest.

01:00.910 --> 01:03.260
Download it free at vodwise.com.
